---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Beyond Diagnosis collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-navy sm:text-4xl">Privacy</h1>
    <div class="prose-editorial mt-8 text-navy/80">
      <p>
        Beyond Diagnosis collects only what's needed to run the newsletter and improve this site:
        the email address you give us when you sign up, and standard, aggregated analytics about
        how pages are used.
      </p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your email address, only if you submit it via the newsletter signup form.</li>
        <li>Basic, non-identifying analytics (pages viewed, general location, device type).</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What we don't do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>We don't sell your information.</li>
        <li>We don't share your email with advertisers.</li>
        <li>We don't ask for or store any health information you haven't chosen to share with us.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Your control</h2>
      <p>
        Every newsletter email includes an unsubscribe link. You can also contact us at any time to
        have your information removed.
      </p>
      <p>This policy may be updated as the site evolves. Check back here for the latest version.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
